  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAND-at-scale &#x2013; Egypt land governance study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study has taken place in the context of the LAND-at-scale programme. The main objectives of the study were 1)	To provide a solid analysis of existing land governance practices at the national and local level, building on existing studies, and with a focus on aspects relevant for a blended participatory land tenure approach. 2)	To present a strong stakeholder analysis, including needs assessment at national and local level.The stakeholder analysis, through interviews and engagement, should also contribute to setting up a network and building support for LAND-at-scale with crucial stakeholders and institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
